# 路径所有权
#
# 说明见 docs/engineering/01-contracts-and-ownership.md 第 7 节。
#
# 下面的 @xxx-owner 是占位符，确定 GitHub 账号后替换成真实用户名。
# 2–3 人规模下一个人可以同时出现在多行；但同一条路径同一时刻只应有一个负责人。
#
# 语法：后匹配的规则覆盖先匹配的，所以通用规则写在前面、专用规则写在后面。

# 默认：任何未被下面规则覆盖的文件
*                                       @integration-owner

# ---- 事实源：术语与产品需求 ----
/CONTEXT.md                             @product-owner @integration-owner
/docs/product/                          @product-owner

# ---- 设计文档 ----
/docs/development/                      @integration-owner
/docs/rfcs/                             @integration-owner @product-owner

# ---- 工程规范与基础设施 ----
/AGENTS.md                              @integration-owner
/CLAUDE.md                              @integration-owner
/CONTRIBUTING.md                        @integration-owner
/docs/engineering/                      @integration-owner
/scripts/                               @integration-owner
/Makefile                               @integration-owner
/.github/                               @integration-owner
/.pre-commit-config.yaml                @integration-owner
/docker/                                @integration-owner

# ---- 公共契约：改动必须走契约变更流程，且不得与业务实现同 PR ----
/openapi/                               @integration-owner @data-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/contracts/        @integration-owner @data-owner
/backend/migrations/                    @data-owner

# ---- 后端模块 ----
/backend/src/goalflow/core/             @integration-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/db/               @data-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/auth/             @backend-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/goals/            @backend-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/planning/         @rules-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/scheduling/       @rules-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/agent/            @agent-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/jobs/             @backend-owner
/backend/src/goalflow/api/              @backend-owner

# ---- 前端 ----
/frontend/src/shared/                   @frontend-owner
/frontend/src/app/                      @frontend-owner
/frontend/src/features/                 @frontend-owner

# ---- 交接卡：由各工作包负责人维护，不设统一 owner ----
# 有意不在此列出 /docs/worklog/，避免每张卡的更新都触发同一个人的评审请求。
